    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kimilimo kie Basaayi ne Balawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Aruni ali, “Ewe, basoleeli bowo nende be lisaaye lienywe mulabiiywa khuloondekhana ne kimilimo kie liiema litakatifu. Ne akhaba lundi ewe ne basoleeli bowo mulabiiywa khuloondekhana ne kimilimo kie busaayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reera balebe bowo, ekholo eye ba raraao eya Lawi, bakhole ne nawe khu khuyeeta wamwene ne basoleeli bowo ne mulikho mukhola kimilimo mwiiema lie buloli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bacha khukhukholela kimilimo ne khukhola kimilimo kioosi kie mwieema. Ne kakhali bakhecha siimbi abiindu bie Abuundu Atakatifu namwe a alutare tawe. Bakhola bario, nibo ne nawe mulafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.27.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bal. 27.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Balaambana ne nawe khukhola kimilimo kie mu liiema lie kumuse. Mbao omundu yesi yesi okundi okheeche siimbi ne nanywe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewe ocha khukhola kimilimo kie Abuundu Atakatifu ne alutare, nio lirima lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi lilekhe khukhwicha lundi khu baandu ba Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naroboore balebe bowo Balawi khukhwama mu Baisiraeli nga siianwa khwinywe. Baanilwe khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, nio bakhole kimilimo mwiiema lie kumuse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ewe ne basoleeli bowo mucha khukhola kimilimo kie busaayi kiloondekhana ne alutare ne buli siosi siosi sisiili mukari mwe epasia. Namueleesie kimilimo kie busaayi nga siianwa. Ne omundu okundi yesi yesi owicha siimbi alafwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kumukabwa kwe basaayi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Aruni ali, Nakhuelesie biianwa bioosi nibio Baisiraeli bambelesia ese. Bibiindu nibio Baisiraeli banjaulila bioosi nakhuelesie ewe ne basoleeli bowo nga sitonyi sie kumukabwa kwowo elala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebio bilala bibiowo khukhwama khu biindu bitakatifu bikhosebwa tawe. Buli siianwa siabwe, buli siianwa sie siakhulia ne buli siianwa sie khurusiao bubwoni; nisio bambelesia siliba sisiowo ne basoleeli bowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenyekhana oliile bibiindu bino Abuundu Atakatifu. Be siseecha bong'ene bakhaliekho. Okhoyela obibukule khuba bitakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khutasa khwako, biianwa bibiindi nibio Baisiraeli bambelesia bicha khuba bibiowo. Ndabielesia ewe, ne babaana bowo be siseecha, nende be siikhaana biise bioosi bibiicha. Buli omundu oli omutakatifu munju mwowo anyala aliakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamafura kamalayi koosi, ne endali endayi yoosi ne biakhulia ne kamatuunda ke khunyoa niko Baisiraeli bambelesia nakhuele ewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bibiaamo bie khunyoa bili mu mikuunda kiabwe kioosi nibio barera khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi biliba bibiowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli siindu siosi mu Isiraeli sisiaebwa khwise sili sisiowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli omwana omubele namwe esaang'i embele niyo Baisiraeli bacha khumbelesia echa khuba eyowo. Ne kakhali ofukiilile kumuruungo kwe khusikula buli omwana omubele, ne kumuruungo kwe khusikula kwa buli esaang'i embele ekhali endakatifu tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bibiindu ebio ne babaandu bakhoyela basikulwe ne bali ne bukhulu bwe kumwesi mulala. Basikule khulwe kumuruungo kwe bitonyi biraano bie chishekeli che efwesa, khuloondekhana ne sikelo sie Abuundu Atakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali emoosi embele ne limeeme libele, ne meeme embele, okhachisikula tawe, sikila chili chindakatifu. Ocha khuanya kamalasile kacho khu alutare. Lundi ocha khwosia kamafura kacho nga siianwa sili esilikakha eyisiimisia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali chinyama chacho chiliba chichenywe nga sitindimilo ne nyama eye sietakho sie lubeka luseecha siaanwe khwinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Biianwa bioosi bitakatifu nibio Baisiraeli baana, nakhuelesie ewe ne basoleeli bowo, alala ne bakhaana bowo. Nakhuele nga siianwa biise bioosi. Yino eli ndakaano eya chumbe mindali na mindali niyo kholile ne nawe ne lisaaye liowo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Aruni ali, “Se ocha khubakho ne kumukabwa mu sibala siabwe tawe. Namwe se ocha khubakho ne sitonye siosi siosi mu nibo tawe, Ese niye sitonyi siowo lundi kumukabwa kwowo mu baandu Baisiraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
