            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Musa ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lundi olaboolela Balawi oli, ‘Ne munyoola khukhwama khu Baisiraeli siianwa sie ekhumi nisio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amuelesia enywe, mukhoya murusie siianwa khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Siianwa esio siikhoya sibe sie ekhumi eye siianwa sie khumi nisio munyoola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siianwa sienywe Sicha khuba nga siianwa nisio Omulimi arusia khulwe biakhulia biyaaya ne endali embia khukhwama mwiloo lie khusuuriramo endali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio mwesi mucha khuaanila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi siianwa khukhwama khu biianwa bioosi bie ekhumi bienywe nibio munyoola khukhwama khu baandu ba Isiraeli, mala khukhwama mu nibio mucha khuaana biianwa bia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi bino khu musaayi Aruni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama khu biianwa bioosi nibio munyoola, mucha khuaana buli siianwa sisienyekhana siaanwe khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Aana khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi siianwa silayi khu bioosi nibio munyoola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mumalile khuaana sitonyi silayi khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, munyala mwabiikha biramire, nga nilwo omulimi ne abuunga biramire enyuma ne amalile khuaana siianwa siewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nono munyala mwalia siramire, enywe ne babaandu be chinju chenywe. Munyala mwalila abuundu osi osi, sikila kuli kumuruungo kwenywe khulwe kimilimo kienywe kie mwiiema lie kumuse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se mucha khubakho ne bubwoni ne mulia tawe, ne mumalile khuaanila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi silayi. Ne mukhola murio aba se mwanyaalutisie bibiindu bitakatifu bie Baisiraeli tawe. Ne lundi ne mukhola murio se mulafwa tawe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
